	["{area:1770} is the cave at the back of {area:1763}, west of the road. Use the {item:12906} on the four braziers inside.\nCareful: Shadow Council mobs of level 53-55 fill the cave and often come in large linked groups, many with stuns: pull at the edge of each group and fight one pack at a time.\nThe Jaedenar Darkweavers, Warlocks and Enforcers in here drop a {item:13140}, about one kill in thirty: keep killing them until it drops. It opens the cell of {npc:11018}, the night elf held in the cave."] = "{area:1770}是{area:1763}后方、道路以西的洞穴。对里面的四个火盆使用{item:12906}。\n小心：53-55级的暗影议会怪物充满洞穴，常常大群连锁，很多带晕眩：在每组边缘拉怪，一次打一拨。\n这里的加德纳尔织暗者、术士和执法者会掉落{item:13140}，大约三十只掉一个：一直杀到掉出为止。它能打开被关在洞里的暗夜精灵{npc:11018}的牢门。",
