	["{npc:6094} takes a {item:159} with the fronds and the vial: if you drank yours, buy another from {npc:6736} in this inn before you hand in."] = "除树叶和药瓶外，{npc:6094}还需要一个{item:159}。如果之前喝掉了，请在交任务前向本旅店的{npc:6736}再买一个。",
